# Agon 08_sand_casualpirates layers 6+7: a metroid latched onto the god-mode player and draining, so
# GetGrowthStage is asked repeatedly (SuckEnergyFromTarget) with the forced growth energy.
@f300 layer 6
@f340 layer 7
@f560 god 1; give missile 20
@f580 send u0547 Activate; send u053d Activate; send u0539 Activate
@f600 tp 300 -300 0
@f620 place u0547 player 2; fsm u0547 SelectTarget
@f650 place u0547 player 2; fsm u0547 Attack
@f700 obj u0547; status
@f900 obj u0547; status
@f1100 obj u0547; status
@f1300 obj u0547; status
@f1500 obj u0547
@f1700 place u053d player 2; fsm u053d SelectTarget
@f1750 place u053d player 2; fsm u053d Attack
@f1800 obj u053d
@f2100 obj u053d
